    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>QuickWick Mats are made up of super absorbent material that lock in 13.5 times its weight in fluid<sup>1</sup></p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Suction mats are permeable non-slip top layer prevents fluid from pooling on the surface</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Suction ring's pliable material allows for easy maneuvrability and repositioning of device</p>\r\n",
